 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published. 'Starting Jank' and 'TESTS' are section headers, not cards. Starting: Mind What You Have Learned / Save You It Can, Dagobah, Heading For The Medical Frigate (posted 'headed for the medical frigate'), The Way Of Things, Wise Advice and Your Insight Serves You Well; several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Jedi Tests posted only as numbers '1'–'6' dested to Great Warrior, A Jedi's Strength, Domain Of Evil, Size Matters Not, It Is The Future You See and You Must Confront Vader. The 'jungle' line (ditto marks under 'dagobah swamp') dested Dagobah: Jungle.",
  "Wise Advice is the Special Edition Effect (not the Reflections III shield). 'luke w/ stick' dested Luke With Lightsaber; 'obi w/stick' Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'han w/blaster' Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol; 'lando w/ blaster' Lando With Blaster Pistol; 'chewie /w blaster' Chewie With Blaster Rifle; 'beru and owen' Owen Lars & Beru Lars; 'twass kahh' Tawss Khaa; 'hassh'n' Major Haash'n; 'hobbie' Derek 'Hobbie' Klivian.",
  "'out of com./transmission terminated' dested Out Of Commission & Transmission Terminated; bare 'bith shuffle' The Bith Shuffle (Premiere), not the Reflections II combo; 'noble sac.' Noble Sacrifice; 'taun taun bones' Tauntaun Bones; 'lukes backpack' Luke's Backpack."
